{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T16:53:07+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T16:53:07+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Getinge AB (publ)","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Devices","country":"Sweden","city":"Gothenburg","website":"https://www.getinge.com","employees":11847,"summary":"Getinge AB (publ) provides products and solutions for operating rooms, intensive-care units, and sterilization departments in Sweden and internationally. The company operates through Acute Care Therapies, Life Science, and Surgical Workflows segments. It offers extracorporeal membrane oxygenation, mechanical ventilation, advanced patient monitoring, ICU infrastructure equipment, and drainage solutions. In addition, the company provides surgical perfusion, endoscopic vessel harvesting, intra-aortic balloon counterpulsation, vascular and cardiothoracic surgery equipment, peripheral stenting, OEM solutions, and beating heart surgery equipment; and operating room equipment, anesthesia, advanced patient monitoring, and operating room integration solutions. Further, it offers pre-cleaning, cleaning and disinfection, sterilization, consumables, endoscope reprocessing, and sterile supply management solutions; connected medical devices, and patient flow management; and low temperature sterilization, biocontainment in vaccine production, terminal sterilization, sterile isolation technology, cleaning and sterilization, aseptic transfer, and large-scale cultivation. Additionally, the company provides bioreactor preparation solution, bioprocess development and optimization, labware cleaning and sterilization, biocontainment, and vivarium. It offers its products through a network of sales companies, as well as through agents and distributors in the Americas, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and the Asia and Pacific. Getinge AB (publ) was founded in 1904 and is headquartered in Gothenburg, Sweden.","exchange":"Stockholm","currency":"SEK","financial_currency":"SEK","summary_fr":"Getinge AB (publ) fournit des produits et des solutions pour les salles d'opération, les unités de soins intensifs et les services de stérilisation en Suède et à l'étranger. La société opère à travers les secteurs des thérapies de soins aigus, des sciences de la vie et des flux de travail chirurgicaux. Il offre une oxygénation extracorporelle de la membrane, une ventilation mécanique, une surveillance avancée des patients, des équipements d'infrastructure de soins intensifs et des solutions de drainage."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":75637030912,"shares_outstanding":254152373,"trailing_pe":26.727623,"forward_pe":25.383915,"price_to_book":2.316464,"ev_to_ebitda":13.655,"ev_to_revenue":2.397,"dividend_yield":0.0174,"payout_ratio":0.45720002,"beta_yahoo":0.816},"targets":{"current_price":277.7,"mean":272.9091,"median":280.0,"high":320.0,"low":193.0,"n_analysts":11,"reco_mean":2.36364,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-10-21"],"eps_avg":4.74867,"eps_low":4.34637,"eps_high":5.29,"revenue_avg":11114520470,"ex_dividend":"2026-04-22","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.15201001,"institutions_pct":0.62125,"institutions_float_pct":0.73262,"institutions_n":152,"institutions":[{"name":"Oregon Public Employees Retirement Fund","pct":0.0007,"shares":179600,"value":49874922,"date":"2022-03-31","chg":1.0}],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0125,"shares":3165902,"value":879171024,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.003},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0082,"shares":2090161,"value":580437735,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.0095999995},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares Core MSCI EAFE ETF","pct":0.0067000003,"shares":1707454,"value":474159996,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0125},{"name":"Goldman Sachs TRT-Goldman Sachs Intl Small Cap Insights Fd.","pct":0.0047,"shar